:: RobinTemple Gifts List
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    What will you give Robin?
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你想把什么送给罗宾？
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<food_gift_list>>
<<if _food_gift_found is true>>
  <<skinicon 'give'>><<lanLink '送给罗宾 (0:05)' 'RobinTemple Gift'>><<pass 5>><<give_gift Robin>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink '重新考虑' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Gift
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<!-- 沿用原版 Robin Gifts 的读取方式：$gift 是 setup.foodstuff 的键，而不是物品对象。 -->
<<set _foodstuff to $gift ? setup.foodstuff[$gift] : undefined>>
<<set _giftLabel to _foodstuff ? _foodstuff.name + (_foodstuff.food.handheld_gift ? ' gift' : '') : ''>>
<<if _giftLabel>><<wearProp _giftLabel>><</if>>
<<if $gift is 'sticky_toffee_pudding'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin stares at the sticky toffee pudding. "That's my favourite," <<he>> says, almost too quietly to hear. <<He>> takes a careful bite, then another.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾望着粘稠的太妃布丁。“这是我最喜欢的。”<<he>>说得很轻，几乎听不清。<<He>>小心尝了一口，接着又吃了一口。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "Bailey used to tell me not to eat this," <<he>> says. "I'm glad you brought it."
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “贝利以前不让我吃这个，”<<he>>说，“你带来这个，我很高兴。”
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr Robin love 3>><<saveFavoriteFood 'Robin' $gift>><<earnFeat 'Hungry Orphan'>><<gglove>>
<<elseif _foodstuff and _foodstuff.food.tags.includes('spicy')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin accepts the spicy food with both hands. After the first mouthful, <<his>> eyes water, but <<he>> does not put it down.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾双手接过辣味食物。第一口下去，<<his>>的眼睛就湿了，但<<he>>没有放下。
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>>
<<elseif _foodstuff and _foodstuff.food.tags.includes('drink')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin looks at the drink, then produces a second straw from <<his>> pocket. "Would you share it?" <<he>> asks.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾看了看饮料，从口袋里摸出另一根吸管。“一起喝吗？”<<he>>问。
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin thanks you and sets the food between you. "I can wash the plate when we're done," <<he>> says.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾道了谢，把食物放在你们中间。“吃完我来洗盘子，”<<he>>说。
  <</language>>
  <<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $gift is 'sticky_toffee_pudding'>>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '问罗宾能不能尝一口' 'RobinTemple Gift Pudding Ask'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink '看罗宾吃完' 'RobinTemple Gift Pudding Watch'>><</lanLink>><br>
<<else>>
  <<loveicon 'hug'>><<lanLink '与罗宾分享' 'RobinTemple Gift Share'>><</lanLink>><br>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink '让罗宾自己享用' 'RobinTemple Gift Alone'>><</lanLink>><br>
<</if>>

:: RobinTemple Gift Pudding Ask
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $speech_attitude is 'bratty'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "You could leave some for me," you say. Robin stops with the spoon halfway to <<his>> mouth.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “你也给我留一口呀。”你说。罗宾举着勺子，停在半空。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      "May I try some?" you ask. Robin looks down at the pudding, then back at you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      “我能尝一口吗？”你问。罗宾看看布丁，又看看你。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    "Sorry, I forgot to ask." Robin pushes the plate towards you. You finish the pudding together, and <<he>> insists on washing the dish.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    “对不起，我忘了问你。”罗宾把盘子推过来。你们一起吃完布丁，<<he>>坚持要把盘子洗干净。
<</language>>
<<npcincr Robin dom -1>><<ldom>><br><br>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Gift Pudding Watch
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You let Robin eat the pudding. <<He>> closes <<his>> eyes after the last bite and smiles before noticing you are still watching.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你看着罗宾吃完布丁。最后一口咽下后，<<he>>闭上眼笑了笑，随后才发现你还在看<<him>>。
<</language>>
<<npcincr Robin dom 1>><<gdom>><br><br>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Gift Share
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if _foodstuff and _foodstuff.food.tags.includes('spicy')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You share the food. Robin's eyes water after the next bite. <<He>> fetches two cups of water, then returns to finish eating beside you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你们分着吃。又吃了一口，罗宾的眼睛就被辣得湿了。<<He>>取来两杯水，回来挨着你把食物吃完。
  <</language>>
<<elseif _foodstuff and _foodstuff.food.tags.includes('drink')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You take the spare straw. Robin waits until you have had a drink before taking another sip.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你接过另一根吸管。罗宾等你喝过一口，才又自己喝起来。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You share the food with Robin. <<He>> moves it closer to your side of the bench whenever <<he>> thinks you have had less.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你与罗宾分享食物。每当<<he>>觉得你吃得少了，就把盘子往你那边推一推。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $gift is 'sticky_toffee_pudding'>><<saveFavoriteFood 'Robin' $gift>><<earnFeat 'Hungry Orphan'>><</if>>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Gift Alone
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if _foodstuff and _foodstuff.food.tags.includes('spicy')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin insists <<he>> can finish it. <<He>> does, though <<his>> eyes water. After fetching a drink, <<he>> takes the dishes to the kitchen.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾坚持说自己能吃完。<<He>>的确吃完了，只是眼睛一直被辣得湿漉漉的。喝过水后，<<he>>把餐具送去厨房。
  <</language>>
<<elseif _foodstuff and _foodstuff.food.tags.includes('drink')>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin drinks slowly while you sit together. <<He>> saves the second straw for another day.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾慢慢喝着，你在旁边陪<<him>>坐着。<<He>>把另一根吸管留到了下次。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Robin eats slowly, keeping you company while the last light fades from the windows. <<He>> thanks you again before taking the plate to the kitchen.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      罗宾慢慢吃着，陪你坐到窗外最后一点天光消失。<<He>>再次道谢，随后把盘子送去厨房。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>
